      "writtenOn": "2024-04-12T13:41:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This has nothing to do with the network status - it\u0027s a denial trying to access a remote_prov_prop property.\n\nWhich is almost certainly your `SystemProperties.get(\"remote_provisioning.hostname\")`.\n\nDisabling SELinux makes the test much less faithful and seems like overkill for just this; is there any other way to do it?\n\nWe could do it from a host test (which could then run the device test). We could forcibly set it to what we want in a RunCommandTargetPreparer with root.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 22,
        "startChar": 205,
        "endLine": 22,
        "endChar": 221
      },
      "revId": "3c340b3dfd2dff58a85cd07c2044bc52f8326b01",
